            "notes": "For round two I almost always go with [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) this works well against [D.Va](hero_e8e1dc68-45c4-47c2-b421-95e33594e6b6)[Reinhardt](hero_a3b6ca2c-6cbd-43dc-bb78-a728e42fba49)[Orisa](hero_91644d44-1093-4f62-ac51-020975465e85) and [Winston](hero_a0ebe5ef-69a6-4a8f-9360-7b7fed8bce88). \n\nYou can also go for the [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) [Stockpile](item_a113eb56-9999-4f22-9bd7-18f4dbd00cc2) if they aren't building Armor.",
