            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-10-01T01:56:16.662422+00:00",
            "notes": "Round 3 is your power spike. \n\nTLDR : \nFor the **Power** we go with [Shared Siphon](item_2a1a58fb-fa85-4561-a337-d4a36aaa7f73), for the perks we go with [Volskaya Ordnance](item_396c0970-daa8-47e3-8049-e65f03fe5cec) and [Emergency Chip](item_c73e060f-94df-4e6b-bb6d-fe2f65e31dd1).\n\nYour job is simple, stay with your tank and pummel the enemy tank.  (Obviously use your better judgment and change targets actively when needed.) \nWe go with [Shared Siphon](item_2a1a58fb-fa85-4561-a337-d4a36aaa7f73) to spread the healing with your tank and nearby supports. Making your team almost unkillable.\n\nWe go with [Volskaya Ordnance](item_396c0970-daa8-47e3-8049-e65f03fe5cec) as you will be shooting the tank and they will have more Max Life than you. You will dealing minimum 15% more weapon damage to them, With the addition of an extra 10% [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed).\nAdd on [Emergency Chip](item_c73e060f-94df-4e6b-bb6d-fe2f65e31dd1) for some extra sustain and [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power).",
